                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngendakalailila bamausowanu mubuzuba obo nindakabagwisya munyika ya-Egepita kuzwa kucifulilo cabutale. Ndakati, Amuswiilile ijwi lyangu akucita makani oonse ngendamulailila, elyo muyooba bantu bangu, ambebo njooba Leza wanu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
