        },
        {
          "text": "kuti nkazuzikizye cikonke ncindakakonkezya bamausowanu, nkaambo ndakasyomezya kubapa nyika iikunka malili abuci, mbubonya mbucibede asunu. Mpawo ndakavuwa kuti, Mbukabede, O Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
