                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bapilukila mumilandu yabamawisaabo bataanzi ibakakaka kuswiilila majwi aangu, batobela mizimu imbi kuti baikombe, aluzubo lwa-Israyeli aluzubo lwa-Juda loonse balijayide cizuminano cangu ncitwakatangana abamawisaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
