          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mweelwe wabaleza bako ulyeelene amweelwe waminzi yako, O Juda, amweelwe wamigwagwa yamu-Jerusalemu uli mbubonya mbuli mweelwe wazipaililo zyako nzowabikila cintu eco cuusya insoni, nkukuti zipaililo zyakutentela ba-Baala tununkilizyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
