        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova wamakamu, nguwenya iwakakusimpika, sunu waamba aanduwe makani mabi, nkaambo kamilimo mibi njibacita bantu baluzubo lwa-Israyeli alwa-Juda, nkaambo bandikalazya mukutentela mizimu tununkilizyo.",
