        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. Ncobeni njoobabweedezya bulumbu bwa bubi bwabo, Bakubusi bayoojazigwa ipanga, abana babo balombe abasimbi ipamba liyoobajaya. ",
